WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.020
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:13.740
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN
SILVER <b>Shooting Star Silver  </b>FANG

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:16.310
Mountains are calling

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.270
The sky is calling

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:27.780
Something awaits you in the distance

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:34.160
So brightly     the blood burns

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:42.290
You understand why you were born

00:00:43.290 --> 00:00:44.630
Run and Run!

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:46.590
Run and Run!

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:50.170
Become the wind, and run

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:56.890
Go on, you're going to surpass the yesterdays you

00:00:57.140 --> 00:01:04.690
You will stand up to yourself     to greater things

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:07.900
That's right!     It is young

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:14.910
It doesn't burn out     A shooting star

00:01:22.330 --> 00:01:27.010
<i>It was not easy for Silver's group to
get Mutsu's Four Heavenly Kings to join.</i>

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:32.430
<i>But with his own death, Terry showed
loyalty towards his friends.</i>

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:35.600
<i>And it touched the Four Heavenly Kings.</i>

00:01:36.650 --> 00:01:43.080
<i>Ouu's and Mutsus united
army were 450 dogs large.</i>

00:01:45.810 --> 00:01:51.280
<i>Meanwhile, John's group was
looking for males in Kyushu.</i>

00:01:51.670 --> 00:02:00.030
TO THE LEADER<i>!!</i>
DAY OF GATHERING<i>! </i>

00:02:19.130 --> 00:02:21.720
<i>Finally... the time is right!</i>

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:26.820
Eh? More countries?

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:30.670
Are there countries beyond
the sea around Mutsu?

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:33.480
Yes, Hokkaido.

00:02:33.690 --> 00:02:38.080
It is probably good to look for
males there before we go to Ouu.

00:02:38.970 --> 00:02:40.840
Kisaragi is right.

00:02:40.970 --> 00:02:43.090
The more the merrier.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:46.090
Hokkaido...

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:53.600
That look again huh, Silver?

00:02:54.890 --> 00:03:00.530
You seem to want to investigate everything,
get hold of everything in the world.

00:03:01.040 --> 00:03:05.030
It is the eyes that gathered all of us.

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:07.170
Anyway that's how I felt.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:09.450
Isn't that so, Benizakura?!

00:03:09.490 --> 00:03:10.780
Exactly!

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:20.210
Then I'll go and tell Ben that we'll go to Hokkaido.

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.790
It's not necessary!

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:25.300
Ben.

00:03:26.290 --> 00:03:28.050
No, there's no time.

00:03:29.180 --> 00:03:30.220
Why?

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:33.350
Look at the moon.

00:03:36.770 --> 00:03:38.820
It's more than half full.

00:03:39.670 --> 00:03:42.350
In ten days it is full.

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:46.110
That day is... That day...

00:03:46.110 --> 00:03:48.320
It is the day of the decisive
battle with Akakabuto!

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:59.870
In other words, today is
the end of our journey.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:02.880
We can only hope that John
comes with reinforcements.

00:04:07.210 --> 00:04:11.640
<i>John, Musashi, Bill,
Wilson and their 200 males-</i>

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:15.760
<i>- had spread in four directions
in the hunt for males.</i>

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:21.480
<i>First, Fighting Dog Musashi won over
Daimon from Bungo and his fifty males.</i>

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:26.480
<i>After that Wilson convinced Raou
from Buzen to join.</i>

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:30.320
<i>And Henry III from Hizen
lost in a fight with John.</i>

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:35.440
<i>Also Kuromamushi from Higo and
Hurricane from Hyuga came along.</i>

00:04:35.490 --> 00:04:36.570
And...

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:43.670
<i>The strongest in Kyushu...</i>

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:46.790
<i>Satsuma's leader Bemu-</i>

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:49.800
<i>- Great tried to persuade.</i>

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:02.480
I know how it goes!
There is no real male here!

00:05:02.930 --> 00:05:06.400
<i>I'll show you a male's determination!</i>

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.400
Commander! Jump off!

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:13.240
<i>Take care of them, leader of Satsuma!</i>

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:15.240
<i>He want to die?...</i>

00:05:15.260 --> 00:05:16.490
I understand!

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:30.590
<i>Bemu was touched by Great's determination to sacrifice himself.</i>

00:05:30.660 --> 00:05:33.880
<i>And joined the fight
against Akakabuto.</i>

00:06:07.410 --> 00:06:11.480
<i>John and Musashi got
all Kyushu to join.</i>

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:17.520
<i>The big army went to
Ouu for the final battle.</i>

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:24.790
<i>At the same time, another follower
defied the waves in the north.</i>

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:31.440
<i>They landed in Mutsu and aimed straight at Ouu.</i>

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:38.320
<i>All of Japan's dogs were
on their way to the same spot.</i>

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:53.720
Look at that!
What the heck?

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:54.430
It's dogs!

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:57.680
What is happening?
They are over a hundred!

00:06:58.410 --> 00:07:01.440
Call the Coast Guard... No, the public
health center... The Police?

00:07:01.480 --> 00:07:03.180
Call the Police!

00:07:03.450 --> 00:07:07.600
John! People are getting worried!
Are we going ashore?

00:07:07.730 --> 00:07:09.430
Of course, don't mind them!

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:10.420
Everyone!

00:07:10.440 --> 00:07:11.440
Don't touch the people!

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:16.420
- Uh... look!
- Oh, they jumped up!

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:18.740
Follow me everyone!

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:20.510
Towards the mountains!

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:27.490
Headquarters! Headquarters! We are currently
flying over where the wild dogs were spotted.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:29.830
But we see nothing!

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:33.340
Come and watch
the TV, the TV!

00:07:36.520 --> 00:07:39.140
The pack that was sighted in
Shimonoseki yesterday morning-

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:44.640
- jumped into the woods with a shepherd
dog in the lead, and disappeared.

00:07:45.610 --> 00:07:48.890
It's Silver and them!
The Shepherd dog ​​must be John!

00:07:49.220 --> 00:07:54.520
But this afternoon, a giant pack in
Okayama's mountain were spotted-

00:07:54.730 --> 00:07:58.870
- and specialists believe it's the same pack.

00:07:59.290 --> 00:08:03.240
They're heading north!
They'll come back, Dad!

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:06.950
Daisuke! Don't be stupid!
With that story again!

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:09.790
Not even we humans can do anything!

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:14.290
I'm going to the Doctor's
place and Granpa's!

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.790
Hey, Wait! Daisuke!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:17.140
Daisuke!

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:22.550
Fuji! Silver is coming back!
He'll be back!

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:27.640
<i>I know it!</i>

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:48.790
Hey!

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.360
Stay, everyone!

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:53.920
What is it Silver?
We do not have time to rest.

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:02.380
Ben, let Cross rest a little.

00:09:02.680 --> 00:09:05.380
We can make up for the time.

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:06.440
But...

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:10.630
Perfect timing!
Silver, the old man here thank you.

00:09:10.630 --> 00:09:10.730
Moss...
Perfect timing!
Silver, the old man here thank you.

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:11.490
Moss...

00:09:11.490 --> 00:09:11.610
I was just going to ask for some rest.
Moss...

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:15.390
I was just going to ask for some rest.

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:16.900
Or something like that, Ben.

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:21.440
Or do you want me to
die before the battle?

00:09:22.290 --> 00:09:26.370
Misty Mountain, don't
bully Ben so much.

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:32.250
I'm going to look around.

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:40.750
Ben, we can't bring
Cross along anymore.

00:09:40.880 --> 00:09:43.010
Could you leave it to me?

00:09:43.050 --> 00:09:44.010
Oliver...

00:09:44.310 --> 00:09:47.760
Another human transportation?

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:51.720
Yes, we still have
time to go to Ouu.

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:55.020
Thank you, Oliver.

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:57.480
Easy for me too!

00:09:57.940 --> 00:09:59.230
Yeah right...

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:07.160
Ben, you prefer a son?

00:10:07.810 --> 00:10:09.490
Uh... yeah I guess...

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:11.490
Nothing to be ashamed of.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:16.250
All males wants a son to
follow him in his footsteps.

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:19.500
Just as Jaguar does for me.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:27.200
Now that you left your life
in someone else's hands-

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:31.010
- you want to leave
a legacy when you die.

00:10:31.010 --> 00:10:32.260
Or am I wrong?

00:10:32.290 --> 00:10:33.270
Moss...

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:38.520
It's only the demon from The
Misty Mountains who talks to himself.

00:10:39.210 --> 00:10:45.780
I also... I want to be honest with you. I some-
times wish that Jaguar was a little smaller.

00:10:51.370 --> 00:10:55.290
Look over there, he is a real male.

00:10:55.310 --> 00:11:00.040
But I can't ask him to leave
the pack and survive by himself.

00:11:01.170 --> 00:11:02.050
Misty Mountain...

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:04.800
Moss...

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:14.440
What is it?
Is the mountain rumbling?

00:12:14.570 --> 00:12:16.620
No.
There's no wind today!

00:12:16.660 --> 00:12:19.620
The leaves are not moving, so it
is impossible to make that sound.

00:12:19.650 --> 00:12:20.540
Then it is...

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:26.220
Silver?!

00:12:27.090 --> 00:12:28.590
Whoa, thats?!

00:12:31.090 --> 00:12:32.350
Who is that?

00:12:36.850 --> 00:12:41.890
I found someone! Over there, fellas!
Here comes Hakuro from Hokkaido!

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:48.900
Stop here!

00:12:58.660 --> 00:12:59.620
What is this?

00:12:59.670 --> 00:13:00.870
What number!

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:04.870
So they were the ones who
made that rumbling sound.

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:11.770
I've been looking for
you, Leader of Ouu!

00:13:12.180 --> 00:13:13.550
Come out!

00:13:14.060 --> 00:13:14.970
What's this now?

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:17.470
How do they know The Leader?

00:13:18.890 --> 00:13:22.480
Young man, this is Mutsu.
Ouu is further ahead.

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.930
I don't know who you are,
but impatience can get you killed!

00:13:26.370 --> 00:13:28.800
...what?
Aren't we in Ouu?

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:32.670
I told you, Boss.
You're impatient.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:37.730
They are good males.
We can't leave them here!

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:42.190
We bring them as a gift
to The Leader of Ouu!

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:45.080
Wait!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.590
Well done, puppy!

00:13:49.630 --> 00:13:53.930
Stay right where you are!
We work for The Leader of Ouu!

00:13:55.470 --> 00:14:00.470
You calm down! Who are you?
Why and where are you from?

00:14:00.540 --> 00:14:01.470
Answer!

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:05.480
What, so thats how it is.

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:13.760
This was fast, forgive
me for the confusion.

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:20.040
We are dogs from Hokkaido.
We swam over the sea yesterday.

00:14:20.740 --> 00:14:21.850
What?

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:25.560
We heard a rumor that Ouu's
Leader was gathering males.

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:29.290
But he never came to us,
so we ran to you instead.

00:14:29.290 --> 00:14:30.630
W-What?

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:32.440
From Hokkaido?

00:14:33.220 --> 00:14:34.930
Excuse me...

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.840
We were the ones who were impolite.

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:39.590
B-Ben...

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:43.680
<i>Ben lower his head...
that proud male...</i>

00:14:45.210 --> 00:14:49.320
Looks like you're the Platoon-
Commander of this group.

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:53.360
I'm Platoon Commander Ben.
Call me Ben.

00:14:54.110 --> 00:14:59.360
It is not easy for a male to lower his head to
a stranger, in front of his subordinates.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:04.370
A good Platoon Commander, I like you.
Raise your head.

00:15:04.390 --> 00:15:05.120
Ben!

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:11.380
I'm Hakuro from Kitami.
Call me Hakuro from now on.

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:14.380
These are my brothers.

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:15.880
Use them as you like.

00:15:16.760 --> 00:15:18.640
We are grateful, Hakuro.

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:21.890
Unbelievable!
We got twice as many, Ben!

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:24.640
Whoa, what now?

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:33.900
Kid, I took one earlier.
A Hokkaido greeting.

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:35.900
What do you think?

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:56.270
<i>The mountain... The mountain rumbles!
Silver and the others are back.</i>

00:16:57.270 --> 00:16:58.180
<i>Finally...</i>

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.780
They're going to fight Akakabuto!

00:17:34.520 --> 00:17:35.520
<i>Silver...</i>

00:17:37.150 --> 00:17:38.030
<i>Daisuke...</i>

00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:46.030
<i>It rumbles in Ouu's mountain.</i>

00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:52.200
<i>The rumble was directed straight at Akakabutos castle.</i>

00:17:53.540 --> 00:17:56.380
<i>From the north came an
army of 1300 males.</i>

00:17:56.500 --> 00:18:00.380
<i>Now that Silver has grown up to be a
good male, leads the way.</i>

00:18:01.550 --> 00:18:02.300
And...

00:18:02.430 --> 00:18:06.550
<i>From the south, John came with 300 males.</i>

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:11.310
<i>It was all brave males gathered
in the name of justice.</i>

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:26.370
John...

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:27.520
Silver...

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:43.300
This is actually one
of Akakabuto's outposts.

00:18:44.050 --> 00:18:46.260
We should not be able to gather here.

00:18:46.450 --> 00:18:53.810
Everything is thanks to The Leader
protecting this place with his life!

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:59.310
Ben, soon the moon will show itself.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:08.360
Look at the moon and close your eyes!
Don't look until I tell you.

00:19:29.340 --> 00:19:31.640
Leader! We are back!

00:19:34.390 --> 00:19:36.390
Open your eyes, everyone!

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:56.410
That is... our Leader?

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:03.960
Leader...

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:06.460
My lady...

00:20:09.220 --> 00:20:14.220
<i>Why... I've never seen him before, but
I can't stop my body from shaking.</i>

00:20:14.720 --> 00:20:16.500
<i>What is this trembling!</i>

00:20:24.270 --> 00:20:29.020
Leader, that body! Must've been
a hard time for you to look like that.…

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:33.160
It's wonderful!
Well done, Ben!

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:39.410
You did well to come here! I thank
you from the bottom of my heart!

00:20:40.000 --> 00:20:40.880
Listen to me!

00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:45.170
Those mountains are the Twin
Pass, where Akakabuto lives.

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:48.420
Now he has secured the
protection of his steel wall!

00:20:50.760 --> 00:20:54.140
That mountain will
eventually be dyed in red.

00:20:54.140 --> 00:20:54.830
But...

00:20:55.430 --> 00:20:57.430
But not with our blood!

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:00.680
It will be the
blood of Akakabuto!

00:21:02.730 --> 00:21:03.730
<i>Father...</i>

00:21:18.240 --> 00:21:19.490
<i>Father...</i>

00:21:22.000 --> 00:21:26.000
They've been born!
Ben, they look just like you!

00:21:31.680 --> 00:21:32.430
Ben!

00:21:33.340 --> 00:21:36.680
Ben, why do you hesitate? Go!

00:21:36.890 --> 00:21:39.930
Go and honestly rejoice at
the birth of your children!

00:21:40.930 --> 00:21:47.930
I also want to rejoice in the
life that was born this day!

00:21:49.690 --> 00:21:54.190
It is for these new lives that we fight!

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:59.030
We will bring justice!
We have to win!

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:01.780
With our back paws!
And our front paws!

00:22:04.540 --> 00:22:13.540
<i>Silver wanted to rush to
the leader and call him "father".</i>

00:22:14.300 --> 00:22:20.260
<i>Even if the father has forgotten
that Silver was his son.</i>

00:22:21.050 --> 00:22:28.260
<i>In his father's tears, he saw
the most magnificent male ever.</i>

00:22:29.070 --> 00:22:35.570
<i>The Leader have to send the warriors,
for his own beliefs, to a place of death.</i>

00:22:35.610 --> 00:22:37.820
<i>It is nothing but a cry of compassion.</i>

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:48.330
<i>Silver was so moved that his whole
body felt like it was about to shatter.</i>

00:22:57.770 --> 00:23:00.690
<b>To be continued...</b>

00:23:14.830 --> 00:23:20.080
When a shower of a moonlight

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:26.210
bathes you gently

00:23:27.310 --> 00:23:32.350
Say goodbye to pain and

00:23:34.190 --> 00:23:40.910
let it flow away

00:23:41.070 --> 00:23:46.910
For he who lives today with all his heart

00:23:47.210 --> 00:23:53.540
a better tomorrow will surely come

00:23:53.880 --> 00:23:59.720
TOMORROW, let us run again

00:24:00.550 --> 00:24:05.600
TOMORROW, lets shine brightly
